   "spoken": "There's a funny knight-to-b6 line where you must be careful not to grab the knight — the queen is pinned. Instead check on b5, then the strongest move is the bishop to g5, and after the queen takes it, a knight fork on c7 wins the rook in the corner. Crushing.",
