   "spoken": "The only serious alternative to the main line is an immediate knight to g4 and queen to h4. Meet it with the queen to f3 — the most practical, since a Stafford player never wants the dead-pawn-down endgame — then defend the one-move threats, take the piece, and you're up material for nothing.",
