   "spoken": "The core points to carry away: delay castling until c3 and the knight to d2 are in; meet the knight to g4 with d4; eliminate Black's dark bishop; don't be afraid to take a hanging knight on g4; and never fear c5 thanks to the knight to c4. Play those and the Stafford falls apart.",
